{
  "fps": 30,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "chongyang",
      "from": 0,
      "durationInFrames": 560,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "九月初九，两九相重。",
          "from": 0,
          "durationInFrames": 95
        },
        {
          "text": "登高，是秋天里的一次出门。",
          "from": 95,
          "durationInFrames": 90
        },
        {
          "text": "赏菊，看一整个秋天。",
          "from": 185,
          "durationInFrames": 90
        },
        {
          "text": "插茱萸，驱蚊驱潮。",
          "from": 275,
          "durationInFrames": 90
        },
        {
          "text": "九层重阳糕，步步高。",
          "from": 365,
          "durationInFrames": 90
        },
        {
          "text": "重阳，本来就是把日子过好。",
          "from": 455,
          "durationInFrames": 105
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hook",
      "from": 560,
      "durationInFrames": 342,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "今年不一样。",
          "from": 0,
          "durationInFrames": 50
        },
        {
          "text": "朋友圈都在转：\n*赤马重阳*，*六十年一遇*。",
          "from": 50,
          "durationInFrames": 106
        },
        {
          "text": "*六十年一遇*，是真的。",
          "from": 156,
          "durationInFrames": 66
        },
        {
          "text": "但它不是异象。",
          "from": 222,
          "durationInFrames": 51
        },
        {
          "text": "是一道*算术题*。",
          "from": 273,
          "durationInFrames": 51
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bingwu",
      "from": 902,
      "durationInFrames": 277,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "今年，农历*丙午年*。",
          "from": 0,
          "durationInFrames": 61
        },
        {
          "text": "*丙*，五行属火，火色赤。",
          "from": 61,
          "durationInFrames": 71
        },
        {
          "text": "*午*，十二生肖里属马。",
          "from": 132,
          "durationInFrames": 66
        },
        {
          "text": "合起来，就是*赤马*。",
          "from": 198,
          "durationInFrames": 61
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sixty",
      "from": 1179,
      "durationInFrames": 423,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "十天干，配十二地支。",
          "from": 0,
          "durationInFrames": 66
        },
        {
          "text": "本来能配出*一百二十种*。",
          "from": 66,
          "durationInFrames": 71
        },
        {
          "text": "可阳干只配阳支，阴干只配阴支。",
          "from": 137,
          "durationInFrames": 91
        },
        {
          "text": "一半的组合，从一开始就不成立。",
          "from": 228,
          "durationInFrames": 91
        },
        {
          "text": "只剩*六十种*，正好一圈六十年。",
          "from": 319,
          "durationInFrames": 86
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "cycle",
      "from": 1602,
      "durationInFrames": 473,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "所以，赤马重阳，\n确实*六十年*才轮到一次。",
          "from": 0,
          "durationInFrames": 111
        },
        {
          "text": "可甲子重阳、乙丑重阳、丙寅重阳……",
          "from": 111,
          "durationInFrames": 101
        },
        {
          "text": "哪一个不是六十年一次？",
          "from": 212,
          "durationInFrames": 71
        },
        {
          "text": "轮到谁，谁就*六十年一遇*。",
          "from": 283,
          "durationInFrames": 76
        },
        {
          "text": "这不是天象，是*日历翻到了同一页*。",
          "from": 359,
          "durationInFrames": 96
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "chima",
      "from": 2075,
      "durationInFrames": 665,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "那为什么偏偏*丙午年*，被说得这么吓人？",
          "from": 0,
          "durationInFrames": 106
        },
        {
          "text": "因为后面跟着*丁未*。",
          "from": 106,
          "durationInFrames": 61
        },
        {
          "text": "*丙午赤马*，*丁未红羊*。",
          "from": 167,
          "durationInFrames": 66
        },
        {
          "text": "南宋柴望，写过一本《*丙丁龟鉴*》。",
          "from": 233,
          "durationInFrames": 96
        },
        {
          "text": "把二十一个丙午丁未年的灾荒战乱，\n列给宋理宗看。",
          "from": 329,
          "durationInFrames": 131
        },
        {
          "text": "可它真正想说的，\n是君臣贤不贤、政令得不得当。",
          "from": 460,
          "durationInFrames": 126
        },
        {
          "text": "是*谏书*，不是预言。",
          "from": 586,
          "durationInFrames": 61
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ending",
      "from": 2740,
      "durationInFrames": 364,
      "captions": [
        {
          "text": "所以，*赤马*年不是异象。",
          "from": 0,
          "durationInFrames": 81
        },
        {
          "text": "它只是干支纪年的一次循环。",
          "from": 81,
          "durationInFrames": 91
        },
        {
          "text": "而重阳，是*丰收*、*长寿*、*敬老*。",
          "from": 172,
          "durationInFrames": 88
        },
        {
          "text": "*九九重阳*，*久久安康*。",
          "from": 260,
          "durationInFrames": 64
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
